# Generated methodology evaluation output (reproducible, never release payload).
# Scoped to this directory (nested .gitignore, not the repo root) so these
# Speck-internal patterns never get copied into a downstream project's
# .gitignore by `speck init`/`speck upgrade` (mergeGitignore only reads the
# repo-root .gitignore as its source).
behavioral/.runs/
behavioral/reports/
skill-routing/reports/
reports/latest.md
